# Saha Plus Work Log

## Project

- Next.js 14 app in `src/app`.
- Start locally with `npm run dev`.

## Completed

### Login screen and interactive plus field

- Replaced the default Next.js starter page with a responsive Saha Plus sign-in screen.
- Added a green welcome panel filled with drifting plus signs.
- Plus signs respond to pointer movement, and pointer presses create a spreading ripple.
- Added reduced-motion handling and a compact mobile layout.
- Files changed: `src/app/page.tsx`, `src/app/globals.css`.

### Plus field refinement

- Increased the field to 260 independently positioned plus signs.
- Added varied, continuous floating paths so the signs drift rather than sit on a grid.
- Plus signs grow as the pointer approaches and shift in response to pointer movement; pointer-down ripple remains.
- Kept the existing login layout and styling intact for this refinement.
- Files changed: `src/app/page.tsx`, `src/app/globals.css`.

## Verification

- `npm run build` was started; record the final result here when available.
